@startuml sd_us216
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US216 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "ATCC" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of airports-routes" as EAR
box "airports-routes-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "RouteController" as RouteController
participant "SearchAlternativeRoutesUseCase" as SearchAlternativeRoutesUseCase
database "own database" as DBAR
end box
collections "peer replicas\nairports-routes-m" as PAR
== GET /api/routes/alternatives ==
Actor -> EAR : GET /api/routes/alternatives\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> RouteController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
RouteController -> SearchAlternativeRoutesUseCase : execute(...)
SearchAlternativeRoutesUseCase -> DBAR : own routes
SearchAlternativeRoutesUseCase -> PAR : GET /internal/replicas/routes\n(every peer in parallel)
PAR --> SearchAlternativeRoutesUseCase : their routes
SearchAlternativeRoutesUseCase -> SearchAlternativeRoutesUseCase : keep the latest change of each record,\nleave out deleted ones; filter, compute, sort, page
SearchAlternativeRoutesUseCase --> RouteController : result
RouteController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Node-Id; X-Partial-Result if both holders of a record were unreachable)
@enduml
